      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+Bump!\n\nThis would be quite useful too for those running under Proton / ProtonGE in Linux as well, as Proton wouldn't have to translate DirectX draw calls to Vulkan which adds CPU overhead and overall reduces VR performance.\n\nthere have already been plenty of requests in the past that were effectively snuffed for native Linux support because \"Proton works just fine\", but yeah. the VR side of this game on Linux is FAR from performant. It *works*, but with a huge penalty in FPS!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
